source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Lists current x86 offers from providers with configured credentials, sorted by currency and base monthly price. Never provisions resources

Usage: leptoskit infra offers [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>              Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --min-memory-gb <MIN_MEMORY_GB>  [default: 2]
  -h, --help                           Print help
  -V, --version                        Print version
